<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian cenbank allots 15.45 bln ATS in repos.</title>
<headline>Austrian cenbank allots 15.45 bln ATS in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it alloted 15.45 billion schillings in two-week repurchase agreements at a fixed rate of three percent, filling 12 percent of the bids.</p>
<p>Last week the bank allotted 6.21 billion schillings, filling five percent of bids, also at a fixed three percent.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 257</p>
